"seed": 41, "text": "破：看见", "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "破：看见", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "customData": {"typography_role": "section_entry", "dup": true}}, {"id": "A_t_0043", "type": "text", "x": 80, "y": 596.0, "width": 299.52, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#273348", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 43, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 43, "text": "只写触动你的一到三个点。", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "只写触动你的一到三个点。", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "customData": {"typography_role": "body"}}, {"id": "A_ellipse_0044", "type": "ellipse", "x": 80, "y": 640.0, "width": 12, "height": 12, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#A95728", "backgroundColor": "#A95728", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.6, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 44, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 841, "customData": {"stroke_role": "accent_detail"}}, {"id": "A_t_0045", "type": "text", "x": 100, "y": 632.0, "width": 225.6, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#84441F", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 45, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 45, "text": "有趣，不等于被触动", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "有趣，不等于被触动", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "customData": {"typography_role": "body"}}, {"id": "A_line_0046", "type": "line", "x": 80, "y": 670.0, "width": 1, "height": 24.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9AA1AC", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.8, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 46, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 879, "customData": {"stroke_role": "rule"}, "points": [[0, 0.0], [0, 24.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null}, {"id": "A_t_0047", "type": "text", "x": 92, "y": 666.0, "width": 249.60000000000002, "height": 90.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#273348", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 47, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 47, "text": "睡眠：睡觉不是关机；\n缺觉脑子转不动；\n关系到老了是否清醒。", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "睡眠：睡觉不是关机；\n缺觉脑子转不动；\n关系到老了是否清醒。", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "customData": {"typography_role": "body"}}, {"id": "A_ellipse_0048", "type": "ellipse", "x": 452, "y": 556.0, "width": 32, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#235D9F", "backgroundColor": "#235D9F", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2.4, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.4, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 917, "customData": {"stroke_role": "object_simple"}}, {"id": "A_t_0049", "type": "text", "x": 461.6382875, "y": 558.25, "width": 21.12, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#FFFFFF", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 49, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 49, "text": "3", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "3", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "customData": {"typography_role": "annotation"}}, {"id": "A_t_0050", "type": "text", "x": 494, "y": 552.0, "width": 271.36, "height": 40.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#235D9F", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 50, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 50, "text": "立：消化成自己的", "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "立：消化成自己的", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "customData": {"typography_role": "section_entry"}}, {"id": "A_t_0051", "type": "text", "x": 494.8, "y": 552.0, "width": 271.36, "height": 40.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#235D9F", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 50, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 50, "text": "立：消化成自己的", "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "立：消化成自己的", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "customData": {"typography_role": "section_entry", "dup": true}}, {"id": "A_t_0052", "type": "text", "x": 452, "y": 596.0, "width": 324.48, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#273348", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 52, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 52, "text": "花几周用自己的话讲出来、放\n进做事方式、连上旧知。", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "花几周用自己的话讲出来、放\n进做事方式、连上旧知。", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "customData": {"typography_role": "body"}}, {"id": "A_ellipse_0053", "type": "ellipse", "x": 452, "y": 670.0, "width": 12, "height": 12, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#A95728", "backgroundColor": "#A95728", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.6, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 53, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 1012, "customData": {"stroke_role": "accent_detail"}}, {"id": "A_t_0054", "type": "text", "x": 472, "y": 662.0, "width": 274.56, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#84441F", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 54, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 54, "text": "记太多，哪条都消化不了", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "记太多，哪条都消化不了", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "customData": {"typography_role": "body"}}, {"id": "A_line_0055", "type": "line", "x": 452, "y": 700.0, "width": 1, "height": 24.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9AA1AC", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.8, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 55, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 1050, "customData": {"stroke_role": "rule"}, "points": [[0, 0.0], [0, 24.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null}, {"id": "A_t_0056", "type": "text", "x": 464, "y": 696.0, "width": 274.56, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#273348", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 56, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 56, "text": "睡眠：一周周观察调整，\n攒出睡前仪式。", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "睡眠：一周周观察调整，\n攒出睡前仪式。", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "customData": {"typography_role": "body"}}, {"id": "A_ellipse_0057", "type": "ellipse", "x": 806, "y": 556.0, "width": 32, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#235D9F", "backgroundColor": "#235D9F", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2.4, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.4, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 57, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 1088, "customData": {"stroke_role": "object_simple"}}, {"id": "A_t_0058", "type": "text", "x": 815.6382875, "y": 558.25, "width": 21.12, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#FFFFFF", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 58, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 58, "text": "4", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "4", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "customData": {"typography_role": "annotation"}}, {"id": "A_t_0059", "type": "text", "x": 848, "y": 552.0, "width": 204.8, "height": 40.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#235D9F", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 59, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 59, "text": "行：自然去做", "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "行：自然去做", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "customData": {"typography_role": "section_entry"}}, {"id": "A_t_0060", "type": "text", "x": 848.8, "y": 552.0, "width": 204.8, "height": 40.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#235D9F", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 59, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 59, "text": "行：自然去做", "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "行：自然去做", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "customData": {"typography_role": "section_entry", "dup": true}}, {"id": "A_t_0061", "type": "text", "x": 806, "y": 596.0, "width": 299.52, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#273348", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 61, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 61, "text": "消化成自己的之后，就会去\n做；做得出来才算学会。", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "消化成自己的之后，就会去\n做；做得出来才算学会。", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "customData": {"typography_role": "body"}}, {"id": "A_line_0062", "type": "line", "x": 806, "y": 666.0, "width": 1, "height": 24.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9AA1AC", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.8, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 62, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 1183, "customData": {"stroke_role": "rule"}, "points": [[0, 0.0], [0, 24.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null}, {"id": "A_t_0063", "type": "text", "x": 818, "y": 662.0, "width": 274.56, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#273348", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 63, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 63, "text": "睡眠：到点照着仪式做，\n不用再想。", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "睡眠：到点照着仪式做，\n不用再想。", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "customData": {"typography_role": "body"}}, {"id": "A_rectangle_0064", "type": "rectangle", "x": 84, "y": 998.0, "width": 1032, "height": 150, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "#EDF2F7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 0, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 64, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 1221, "customData": {"stroke_role": "fill_only"}}, {"id": "A_line_